sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as llmdbenchmark CLI<br/>(workstation / CI)
    participant WS as Local Workspace
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Helm as Helm Chart Repos<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant DL as Model Download Job
    participant HF as huggingface.co<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant VP as vLLM preprocess<br/>(decode pod)
    participant Curl as Ephemeral curl pod
    participant H as Harness Pod
    participant Stack as Gateway → EPP → vLLM<br/>endpoint port
    participant EPP as EPP /metrics<br/>HTTPS
    participant PVC as Workload PVC /requests
    participant DA as Data-access Pod<br/>rsync 20873/TCP
    participant Thanos as Thanos Querier<br/>443/TCP
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage<br/>443/TCP
    participant Prism as prism.llm-d.ai<br/>443/TCP
    participant S3 as Amazon S3<br/>443/TCP
    participant Tel as Telemetry Receiver<br/>443/TCP

    Note over CLI,VP: Flow 1 - Standup (modelservice method)
    CLI->>WS: Render plan (Jinja2 manifests, helmfiles)
    CLI->>API: Create ns / SA / RBAC / secrets / PVCs<br/>HTTPS TLS (verify may be disabled)<br/>kubeconfig / Bearer
    CLI->>Helm: helm / helmfile chart fetch<br/>HTTPS TLS, no auth
    API-->>DL: Schedule Job
    DL->>HF: Download weights<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, HF_TOKEN
    VP->>API: PATCH own pod labels (443/TCP)<br/>TLS: SA CA or CERT_NONE fallback<br/>kubeconfig / SA token

    Note over CLI,PVC: Flow 2 - Benchmark run
    CLI->>API: Create profile ConfigMaps + harness pod<br/>HTTPS TLS, kubeconfig
    Curl->>Stack: GET /v1/models (smoke test)<br/>curl -k, none / token
    H->>Stack: OpenAI API load (HTTP)<br/>encryption scenario-dependent, none / token
    Stack-->>H: Completions / streaming tokens
    H->>EPP: Scrape /metrics (collect_metrics.sh)<br/>HTTPS TLS, Bearer metrics-reader secret
    H->>PVC: Write raw results + Benchmark Report
    CLI->>API: kubectl cp via exec (HTTPS/SPDY TLS)
    API->>DA: exec / tar
    DA-->>CLI: Results files
    CLI->>Thanos: Capture cluster metrics<br/>HTTPS curl -k, Bearer

    Note over CLI,Tel: Flow 3 - Results publication
    CLI->>GCS: gcloud storage cp / GCS SDK<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, Google ADC
    alt GCS SDK unavailable
        CLI->>Prism: GCS proxy fallback<br/>HTTPS TLS, no client auth
    end
    CLI->>S3: aws s3 cp<br/>HTTPS TLS 1.2+, AWS credentials
    opt LLMDBENCH_TELEMETRY_ENABLED
        CLI->>Tel: POST results / metadata<br/>HTTPS TLS, Bearer OIDC
    end
